flowchart TD
  A["Venus QuickJS：选择文档内容并提交"] --> B["读取 `message.composer`、`message.timeline` 完整 VM"]
  B --> C["Frame 内 `ActionBinding(message.create)`"]
  C --> D["native 注入 actor/requestId/observedRevision/surfaceEpoch"]
  D --> E["ActionInvocationEnvelope / HostObservation / Inbound"]
  E --> F["MobileImSdk -> CoreBridge -> helix-driver-ffi"]
  F --> G["`Tick::Command/Inbound/PortReply/Timer`"]
  G --> H["`upload`、`storage_upsert`、`http_write`、`projection`"]
  H --> I["Go authority：`POST /api/cses/posts/create`，同上，`type=DOCUMENT`；占位字段建议 `message/simpleMessage="【文档】 http://doc.cses7.com/doc/abc123"`，`props.document={version:1,url:"http://doc.cses7.com/doc/abc123",title:"打开文档",placeholder:true}`；后续替换为 message-v3 的 `props.document={snapshot,version:1}`"]
  I --> J["WS/PortReply：`post`"]
  J --> K["`PersistAtomic -> PersistOk`；SQLite `message`、`pending_send`"]
  K --> L{"PersistOk?"}
  L -- "否" --> X["保留旧 VM；ActionReceipt failed；可重试"]
  L -- "是" --> M["SurfaceComposer：`message.composer`、`message.timeline`"]
  M --> N["InteractionFrameV2 schemaVersion=2"]
  N --> O["FFI batch -> C++ SurfaceRuntime 整帧校验"]
  O --> P{"epoch/revision/causation 合法?"}
  P -- "否" --> Y["保留最后一致 VM；请求 snapshot/resync"]
  P -- "是" --> Q["原子提交 ComposerVm + TimelineWindowVm（文档内容）"]
  Q --> R["QuickJS im.surface.view/pending"]
  R --> S["移动 UI：文档消息显示文档卡片、发送状态和失败后的输入恢复，不由 JS 解读 document props"]
  S --> T["FrameApplied / directive ack / action terminal"]
